{
  "version": 1,
  "id": "guides/patterns/emit-and-await",
  "snippet": "guides/patterns/emit-and-await.ts",
  "topology": {
    "mainChannel": "main",
    "channels": [
      {
        "name": "main",
        "events": null,
        "proxies": []
      },
      {
        "name": "work",
        "events": ["task", "task-result"],
        "proxies": []
      },
      {
        "name": "client",
        "events": ["answer"],
        "proxies": ["sse"]
      }
    ],
    "agents": [
      {
        "name": "coordinator",
        "listensTo": ["user-message"],
        "emits": ["task", "answer"],
        "subscribes": ["main"],
        "publishesTo": ["work", "client"]
      },
      {
        "name": "worker",
        "listensTo": ["task"],
        "emits": ["task-result"],
        "subscribes": ["work"],
        "publishesTo": ["work"]
      }
    ],
    "terminalEvents": ["answer"]
  },
  "events": [
    {
      "i": 0,
      "name": "user-message",
      "channels": ["main"],
      "by": null,
      "cause": null,
      "payload": {
        "text": "orders from last week"
      },
      "deliveredTo": ["coordinator"],
      "line": 53
    },
    {
      "i": 1,
      "name": "task",
      "channels": ["work"],
      "by": "coordinator",
      "cause": 0,
      "payload": {
        "query": "orders from last week"
      },
      "deliveredTo": ["worker"],
      "line": 16
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "name": "task-result",
      "channels": ["work"],
      "by": "worker",
      "cause": 1,
      "payload": {
        "rows": 42
      },
      "deliveredTo": [],
      "line": 32,
      "replyTo": "coordinator"
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "name": "answer",
      "channels": ["client"],
      "by": "coordinator",
      "cause": 0,
      "payload": {
        "text": "Found 42 rows"
      },
      "deliveredTo": [],
      "line": 23
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "name": "m4trix:run.completed",
      "channels": ["main", "work", "client"],
      "by": null,
      "cause": 3,
      "payload": {
        "reason": "terminal-event",
        "event": "answer"
      },
      "deliveredTo": [],
      "line": null
    }
  ],
  "end": {
    "name": "m4trix:run.completed"
  },
  "walkthrough": [
    "`user-message` is published on `main` from outside the network; `coordinator` picks it up.",
    "`coordinator` receives it and emits `task` on `work`, a channel declared for `task` and `task-result`; `worker` takes it from there.",
    "`worker` receives it and emits `task-result` on `work`; `coordinator`, waiting in `emitAndAwait`, receives it as its reply (same `meta.correlationId`).",
    "In response to `user-message`, `coordinator` emits `answer` on `client`, a channel that only carries `answer`; no agent subscribes to `client`, so `answer` leaves the network through its `sse` proxy and, as a terminal event, ends the run.",
    "The runtime then publishes `m4trix:run.completed` on every channel (`main`, `work` and `client`) to close the run."
  ]
}
